244
00:12:55,533 --> 00:12:56,533
<i>- Where are you going?
- Wait! Wait!</i>

245
00:12:56,667 --> 00:12:57,400
<i>- Where are you going?
- Just wait a second!</i>

246
00:12:57,533 --> 00:12:59,067
